<p>A 21-year-old Austrian man identified under local privacy rules as Beran A. pleaded guilty Tuesday as his trial opened in Wiener Neustadt, Austria, in a case involving a plot to attack a Taylor Swift concert in Vienna in August 2024. He faced charges including terrorist offences and membership in a terrorist organization. Prosecutors said he had pledged allegiance to Islamic State and planned an attack linked to Swift’s Eras Tour performances. Authorities thwarted the plan before it was carried out, but Austrian officials cancelled all three of Swift’s scheduled Vienna shows, which were expected to draw more than 195,000 people in total. Beran A. was arrested on Aug. 7, 2024, a day before the first concert, after a tip that accounts citing authorities attributed to U.S. intelligence services or the CIA. A second 21-year-old defendant, Arda K., is being tried in the same case on allegations that he had links to an Islamic State cell and other attack plans abroad.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/3Hy4mD9oySa2BvaZs3bKbd2uJTPnFvDY0RIWjbB9YUOjvHh4jzHsEZLWEcyi-pFvYW_M9S-E5ORRz7wdmJZ3KS609IcnQ8QxeLDUqziPDOCaZb72iyqqVQcj1T4cGxW6sHDFXqg9nbveJN-AEVno_S8FGswJXYJquTyMFGKb61cERtf1Cq8PS-1qd84yGuLCaiPHA-SvL6boqnrZdojyr8PnAlygz2NZN_49RSAZlUU7Bp0aG_PfXMSftu35OlSG_BDbTNOrF1JFbEic4Q' alt='Defendant Beran A. hides his face behind file folders as he is escorted out of the courtroom in Wiener Neustadt, Austria.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Explosive evidence: The state prosecutor told the court that police found an almost completed bomb during a search of Beran A.’s home.</li><li>Crowd target: Prosecutors said the concert plot included targeting onlookers outside Ernst Happel Stadium, where up to 30,000 people could gather outside and 65,000 more were expected inside each night.</li><li>Other allegations: Beran A. admitted involvement in a plan in Dubai that was not carried out, while denying that he helped another man carry out a knife attack in Saudi Arabia.</li><li>Possible sentence: The defendant could face up to 20 years in prison if convicted of the charges against him.</li></ul><blockquote>Of course, he deeply regrets it all - Anna Mair</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Defense lawyer Anna Mair: Mair told AFP that Beran A. pleaded guilty to all charges except attempted murder. (<a href='https://www.nacion.com/el-mundo/intento-de-atentado-en-concierto-de-taylor-swift/PINZQABZERCFZJWJTEWVGG26TA/story/'>La Nación</a>)</li><li>Austrian prosecutors: Prosecutors alleged that Beran A. had contact with Islamic State members and hoped to kill as many people as possible. (<a href='https://www.irishnews.com/news/world/man-pleads-guilty-to-plotting-attack-on-taylor-swift-concert-in-vienna-XXOPUYQUSBPEXDLNVRCQP6Y4UI/'>Irish News</a>)</li><li>Beran A.: Speaking in court, he said he knew he was supposed to carry out jihad but feared dying. (<a href='https://www.nacion.com/el-mundo/intento-de-atentado-en-concierto-de-taylor-swift/PINZQABZERCFZJWJTEWVGG26TA/story/'>La Nación</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3351728/austrian-islamic-state-man-admits-plot-taylor-swift-concert-vienna'>Austria Islamic State man admits plot on Taylor Swift concert in Vienna</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/culture/music/article-taylor-swift-concert-vienna-attack-plot-guilty/'>Defendant pleads guilty to plotting attack on Taylor Swift concert in Vienna</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/austrian-man-pleads-guilty-to-plotting-attack-on-taylor-swift-concert-11420358#publisher=newsstand'>Austrian Man Pleads Guilty To Plotting Attack On Taylor Swift Concert</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c05d5qgprjzo'>Man admits plotting attack on Taylor Swift concert in Vienna</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/28/world/europe/taylor-swift-austria-guilty-plea.html'>Man 